Removed the redundant bounds check on `profileIndex`, which is guaranteed valid whenever `profile` is non-null by the `Field` constructor invariant, eliminating one compare/branch on the hot path.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    if (profile == NULL)
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].num;
}
```